{"id": "EUVD-2026-81759", "enisaUuid": "1d2d3b99-9d42-328c-afff-3cdf901d5517", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nsmb/server: fix null-ptr-deref in ksmbd_ipc_tree_connect_request()\n\nSee the procedure below:\n\n  ksmbd_tree_conn_connect\n    ksmbd_share_config_get\n      share->name = kstrdup() // fail\n      if (!test_share_config_flag(share, KSMBD_SHARE_FLAG_PIPE)) // false\n      // do not check `share->name`\n    ksmbd_ipc_tree_connect_request\n      strlen(share->name) // null-ptr-deref", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:06:55", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:50:15", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5ffd180307a5ea34dae7f90ff9573ebed6b7fb12", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4eb74a34ea401abfbbd5991076715dae3de938df", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8461f27902727ad434375caf13a0100aafc0340f", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7065d3648b1a48d2c49da3d6364dd3c4d503b10c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d2ccf905f47d2344270749f4dfa905afcd3edeb0"], "aliases": ["GHSA-72gq-5j57-9667", "CVE-2026-90166"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "01cff0e0-04ed-3f28-9fdd-7cfe801cc3b7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5.15"}, {"id": "01de5813-b460-34f3-ae87-42bbf3267e43", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.6"}, {"id": "06f9cbcf-b9aa-3e83-95fb-683da7bf1ae1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "e2f34481b24db2fd634b5edb0a5bd0e4d38cc6e9 <4eb74a34ea401abfbbd5991076715dae3de938df"}, {"id": "1d54ebad-c8f4-399a-af03-719f0d586987", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "2cb6c751-6053-3a2f-a971-8c88aec7a424", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "4ce4d007-9674-3bdd-bdbd-4fa8c9123193", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendo